000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RPTPAGE.
000300* The page engine of the Report Writer against VIII 2.5.5: a PAGE
000400* clause with every phrase, the two counters as data items,
000500* a heading on an absolute line, two-line details fitted by the
000600* trial sum, a detail on an absolute line fitted by rule 3a, a
000700* subscripted SOURCE, and PAGE-COUNTER set by the program.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-PROUT.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 FILE SECTION.
001400 FD  PRINT-FILE
001500     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
001600     REPORT IS PAGED-RPT.
001700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001800 01  WS-IDX   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
001900 01  WS-NUM   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
002000 01  WS-LC    PIC ZZ9.
002100 01  WS-TAB.
002200     05  WS-NAME  PIC X(6) OCCURS 3 TIMES.
002300 01  WS-K     PIC 9 VALUE 0.
002400 REPORT SECTION.
002500 RD  PAGED-RPT
002600     PAGE LIMIT IS 16 LINES
002700     HEADING 2
002800     FIRST DETAIL 5
002900     LAST DETAIL 12
003000     FOOTING 14.
003100 01  PAGE-HEAD TYPE PAGE HEADING.
003200     02  LINE 2.
003300         05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(12) VALUE 'PAGED REPORT'.
003400         05  COLUMN 20 PIC X(4)  VALUE 'PAGE'.
003500         05  COLUMN 25 PIC ZZ9   SOURCE PAGE-COUNTER.
003600     02  LINE PLUS 1.
003700         05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(3)  VALUE 'NUM'.
003800         05  COLUMN 8  PIC X(4)  VALUE 'NAME'.
003900 01  TWO-LINER TYPE DETAIL.
004000     02  LINE PLUS 1.
004100         05  COLUMN 1  PIC 999   SOURCE WS-NUM.
004200         05  COLUMN 8  PIC X(6)  SOURCE WS-NAME (WS-K).
004300     02  LINE PLUS 1.
004400         05  COLUMN 8  PIC X(9)  VALUE '(second)'.
004500 01  ONE-LINER TYPE DETAIL.
004600     02  LINE PLUS 1.
004700         05  COLUMN 1  PIC 999   SOURCE WS-NUM.
004800         05  COLUMN 8  PIC X(6)  VALUE 'single'.
004900 01  FIXED-LINER TYPE DETAIL.
005000     02  LINE 10.
005100         05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(13) VALUE '-- LINE 10 --'.
005200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005300 MAIN-PARA.
005400     MOVE 'ALPHA ' TO WS-NAME (1).
005500     MOVE 'BETA  ' TO WS-NAME (2).
005600     MOVE 'GAMMA ' TO WS-NAME (3).
005700     OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
005800     INITIATE PAGED-RPT.
005900     PERFORM TWO-PARA VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
006000         UNTIL WS-IDX > 5.
006100     MOVE LINE-COUNTER TO WS-LC.
006200     DISPLAY 'LINE-COUNTER AFTER FIVE ' WS-LC.
006300     PERFORM ONE-PARA VARYING WS-IDX FROM 6 BY 1
006400         UNTIL WS-IDX > 9.
006500     GENERATE FIXED-LINER.
006600     PERFORM ONE-PARA VARYING WS-IDX FROM 10 BY 1
006700         UNTIL WS-IDX > 12.
006800     MOVE 100 TO PAGE-COUNTER.
006900     PERFORM TWO-PARA VARYING WS-IDX FROM 13 BY 1
007000         UNTIL WS-IDX > 16.
007100     TERMINATE PAGED-RPT.
007200     CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
007300     STOP RUN.
007400 TWO-PARA.
007500     MOVE WS-IDX TO WS-NUM.
007600     ADD 1 TO WS-K.
007650     IF WS-K > 3 MOVE 1 TO WS-K.
007700     GENERATE TWO-LINER.
007800 ONE-PARA.
007900     MOVE WS-IDX TO WS-NUM.
008000     GENERATE ONE-LINER.
